{
  "name": "dsh-illuminating-skin",
  "version": "0.4.17",
  "description": "IntelliJ IDEA 深色风的 DSH 毛玻璃皮肤：主栏是四周留缝的浮起卡片，左栏整列与窗口标题带连成一块玻璃，设置 / 搜索 / 菜单 / tooltip / toast 等全部浮层统一磨砂；会话头右侧的色点按钮可切换标题带发光颜色（六套预设 + 自定义取色）。前置要求：必须先安装 dsh-claude-style 并把「配色」设为跟随宿主，未安装时主栏卡片、标题带整合与顶部按钮位置会退化。以样式注入为主，不调用宿主 API。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "theme",
    "glass",
    "glassmorphism",
    "frosted",
    "frosted-glass",
    "acrylic",
    "translucent",
    "idea",
    "intellij",
    "dark"
  ],
  "license": "GPL-3.0-only",
  "author": "ExTetragon",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/ExTetragon/dsh-illuminating-skin.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/ExTetragon/dsh-illuminating-skin#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/ExTetragon/dsh-illuminating-skin/issues"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "check": "node --check lib/client.js && node --check lib/index.js"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "dsh-claude-style": ">=0.19.0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "dsh-claude-style": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": ["theme"],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
